&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Duolingo English Test&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Duolingo English Test is a high-stakes test — Duolingo style: convenient, fast, and affordable and trusted by top institutions around the world. Students interested in studying abroad can certify their English with the Duolingo English Test in place of other standardized tests like the TOEFL and IELTS. Using AI and remote proctoring, students can take the test online, on demand, anywhere in the world. If you love making a difference in education through technology, this is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an operationally strong and resourceful marketing professional to scale the Duolingo English Test across the UK and ANZ. This role is focused on growing acceptance and usage among universities, governments, and key education stakeholders, with events and partnerships as a primary growth lever. You will design and run high-impact engagement programs that move institutions from awareness to adoption, while building scalable systems that support long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a core member of our global organization the ideal candidate will not only be an outstanding, self-motivated problem solver, who can work and take decisions independently, but is also a proactive and team-oriented communicator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠&amp;nbsp; You will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the B2B regional marketing strategy for institutional audiences across the UK, Europe and ANZ, with clear ownership of adoption, engagement, and pipeline metrics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Institutional Engagement team&amp;nbsp; to align marketing efforts with institutional outreach and conversion goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and execute a comprehensive events strategy including university roadshows, partner events, webinars, and industry conferences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop repeatable playbooks that can scale across markets while maintaining high quality execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to deliver cohesive, high-quality messaging across all touchpoints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics for campaigns, evaluate performance, and inform future strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&amp;nbsp; You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of marketing experience, with strong exposure to B2B or institutional marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and executing events or field marketing programs that drive engagement and conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in international education, EdTech, or a related sector is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the UK and or ANZ education landscape, especially universities and study abroad pathways&lt;/li&gt;
