&lt;li&gt;Drive automation and system improvements to scale from 0-to-1 and beyond, leveraging technology to make localized content production simpler, more repeatable, and more transparent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the metrics for your vertical to improve strategy, decision-making, and prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate relationships with key partners (marketing, product, design, engineering) to develop a localization strategy and roadmap for your area; develop and socialize best practices and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish workflows and tooling that increase localization throughput and quality across our system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&amp;nbsp; You have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience crafting localization strategy and systems for new features and experiences, in collaboration with product, design, and engineering partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and leading localization programs in a cross-functional consumer app environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-savviness. You are proficient in managing and scaling workloads using technology, including AI, CMSs, and CAT tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills; you influence without authority and align diverse stakeholders to drive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort defining goals and metrics and translating insights into actionable engineering requirements and scalable workflow specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐&amp;nbsp; Exceptional candidates will have...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in localization quality frameworks and ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with internationalization engineering concepts such as Unicode handling and message format in consumer apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting international product growth in emerging or high-complexity language markets&lt;/li&gt;
