&lt;li&gt;Own full‑cycle recruiting (intake, sourcing, assessments, offers) and drive efficient, high‑quality hiring outcomes for various roles in our technical functions, with potential to work on some non-technical roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers to align on role requirements, interview plans, and timelines; help set clear expectations and keep searches on track.&lt;/li&gt;
